<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:33.770
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:37.640
<i>yoru wa hakaba de undoukai</i>

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:37.640
<i>Sports festivals in the graveyard at night</i>

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:42.520
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:42.520
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:46.650
<i>obake wa shinanai</i>

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:46.650
<i>Ghosts don't die</i>

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:50.070
<i>byouki mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:50.070
<i>Or get sick or anything</i>

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:54.540
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:54.540
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:58.870
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:58.870
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.840
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.840
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:02:20.810 --> 00:02:21.860
The pain...

00:02:44.960 --> 00:02:45.960
CHAPTER 6

00:02:46.510 --> 00:02:50.840
THE MISFORTUNE OF THE SUNEKOSURI

00:02:54.780 --> 00:02:58.500
Tch-tch-tch. Shiro. Shiro.

00:03:01.270 --> 00:03:04.110
Over here, Shiro.

00:03:04.630 --> 00:03:06.500
More this way.

00:03:10.740 --> 00:03:13.010
Over here.

00:03:14.910 --> 00:03:16.840
Boo!

00:03:19.520 --> 00:03:21.420
There, there, Shiro...

00:03:21.420 --> 00:03:25.360
I bought you something special today.

00:03:26.820 --> 00:03:29.720
Here. Doesn't it look yummy?

00:03:32.970 --> 00:03:35.910
What? You're not going to eat after all?

00:03:35.910 --> 00:03:39.830
Honestly, where do you get food
all the time?

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:04.230
Oh, my...

00:04:04.790 --> 00:04:06.510
Shiro!

00:04:17.720 --> 00:04:20.970
Honestly, you're such a little rascal.

00:04:20.970 --> 00:04:22.500
Hey, you home?

00:04:28.860 --> 00:04:29.840
Yo.

00:04:29.840 --> 00:04:35.240
Sho! What is this all of a sudden?
You never even called all this time.

00:04:35.240 --> 00:04:38.280
I come home
and I'm getting scolded already?

00:04:38.280 --> 00:04:42.470
I'm not about to welcome a son
who just ran off to Tokyo.

00:04:42.470 --> 00:04:44.790
You're still mad about that?

00:04:44.790 --> 00:04:48.230
If you're going to come in,
first offer incense sticks to your father.

00:04:48.230 --> 00:04:52.850
Will you get off my case?
I was about to do it.

00:04:53.590 --> 00:04:55.490
What's this?

00:04:55.490 --> 00:04:59.370
This is Shiro.
We've started living together recently.

00:04:59.370 --> 00:05:02.410
Shiro's the only family I have left.

00:05:03.350 --> 00:05:05.120
What? That's stupid.

00:05:05.120 --> 00:05:07.610
What would you know abou--

00:05:08.610 --> 00:05:13.670
What? Did you catch something from
living with a dirty cat?

00:05:18.370 --> 00:05:20.990
You didn't have to kick me out! Hey!

00:05:20.990 --> 00:05:23.340
Go back to Tokyo already!

00:05:24.020 --> 00:05:26.880
That's nice to hear!

00:05:31.610 --> 00:05:35.110
Who'd want to
come back to a village like this?

00:05:35.110 --> 00:05:38.610
Seriously, that old lady is always...

00:05:41.220 --> 00:05:42.430
Dammit.

00:05:42.430 --> 00:05:44.450
Oh, Sho-kun?

00:05:44.450 --> 00:05:47.230
You're Masae-san's little Sho-kun, right?

00:05:47.230 --> 00:05:49.610
-Hello.
-What have you been up to?

00:05:49.610 --> 00:05:52.880
Nothing much. Just doing odd-and-end jobs.

00:05:52.880 --> 00:05:56.900
"Oddanen"? That sounds complicated...

00:05:56.900 --> 00:06:00.370
Well, I know work must keep you busy,

00:06:00.370 --> 00:06:04.770
but, ever since you left,
Masae-san's been pretty depressed.

00:06:05.330 --> 00:06:06.830
Really?

00:06:06.830 --> 00:06:10.880
It's already a quiet village,
but now there are fewer and fewer people.

00:06:10.880 --> 00:06:14.800
See over there?
Uchimura-san passed away last winter.

00:06:14.800 --> 00:06:17.840
Not only that,
he was in a rather strange state.

00:06:17.840 --> 00:06:20.240
They found him looking like a mummy.

00:06:20.240 --> 00:06:21.870
A mummy?

00:06:21.870 --> 00:06:23.470
Oh, see you later, Sho-kun!

00:06:23.470 --> 00:06:25.770
Wait. Let me on!

00:06:25.770 --> 00:06:27.450
A mummy...

00:06:33.420 --> 00:06:36.160
You're that...

00:06:48.040 --> 00:06:50.850
Well, well, what's today's letter?

00:06:50.850 --> 00:06:54.190
What's this? Hmm... Oh?

00:06:54.190 --> 00:06:56.420
Rat Man, what are you doing?

00:06:56.420 --> 00:06:59.390
Someone's asking you to
get rid of a <i>yokai</i>.

00:07:00.930 --> 00:07:05.810
Don't worry. I, Rat Man, won't force
you to go on your own, Kitaro.

00:07:05.810 --> 00:07:07.120
You're coming, too?

00:07:07.120 --> 00:07:12.880
Of course! Under the blue sky, sweating
for people and the world! That's my--

00:07:12.880 --> 00:07:15.070
-Let's go.
-Yes.

00:07:15.400 --> 00:07:16.840
K-Kitaro!

00:07:23.910 --> 00:07:26.330
Are you Sho-san?

00:07:26.330 --> 00:07:29.370
What? Does that mean you're Kitaro?

00:07:29.370 --> 00:07:31.160
Kitaro is me.

00:07:31.160 --> 00:07:35.380
Are you sure, kid?
I know your guardian's here, but...

00:07:35.380 --> 00:07:38.010
I'm Kitaro's father.

00:07:38.010 --> 00:07:39.210
What?!

00:07:39.210 --> 00:07:41.200
We've got the same eyes.

00:07:41.970 --> 00:07:43.140
"Eyes"?

00:07:43.140 --> 00:07:45.600
I'm Kitaro's manager.

00:07:45.600 --> 00:07:46.950
O-Oh...

00:07:46.950 --> 00:07:50.350
Well, isn't this a lush, green,
or shall I say, tasteful place.

00:07:50.350 --> 00:07:53.060
It's quite wonderfully drab.

00:07:53.060 --> 00:07:55.580
You mean it's the boonies, right?

00:07:56.230 --> 00:07:58.650
Oh no, I'd never...

00:07:58.650 --> 00:08:01.650
By the way, about our retainer...

00:08:01.650 --> 00:08:03.220
Huh? This much?!

00:08:03.220 --> 00:08:05.700
Hey, don't step out of line!

00:08:05.700 --> 00:08:08.370
Don't pay him any mind.

00:08:08.370 --> 00:08:10.660
Now, Sho-san, let's go.

00:08:10.660 --> 00:08:13.980
Uh, actually I'll be waiting at the inn
in the next village.

00:08:14.210 --> 00:08:16.630
Come get me when
you've driven off that <i>yokai</i>.

00:08:16.630 --> 00:08:19.190
-But...
-I appreciate it!

00:08:21.010 --> 00:08:24.910
His own mother's in danger,
and yet, how cold.

00:08:33.600 --> 00:08:37.070
Are you trying to cheer me up, Shiro?

00:08:39.020 --> 00:08:42.200
My cold's pretty stubborn this year...

00:08:44.030 --> 00:08:47.590
You're the only one
who remains as my child.

00:08:49.580 --> 00:08:51.750
That cat, huh?

00:08:51.750 --> 00:08:54.830
Well, they seem quite close.

00:08:54.830 --> 00:08:58.440
It's probably just an act.
Cats are nothing but trouble.

00:08:58.440 --> 00:09:03.320
They're cruel and violent and
have no compassion. Disgusting.

00:09:10.080 --> 00:09:11.790
Kitaro!

00:09:22.190 --> 00:09:25.380
Why are you with that human?

00:09:30.720 --> 00:09:36.730
If you won't speak, I'll have to use force
to keep you and Masae-san apart.

00:09:40.790 --> 00:09:43.100
Keep us apart?

00:09:45.720 --> 00:09:48.700
Why are you trying to
take Mom away from me?!

00:09:59.420 --> 00:10:01.670
She is my mom!

00:10:01.670 --> 00:10:04.300
Nonsense.
What are you planning for Masae-san?!

00:10:07.530 --> 00:10:09.090
If she's with you...

00:10:16.140 --> 00:10:18.270
Masae-san will die!

00:10:25.880 --> 00:10:29.010
She'll die...? Don't lie to me!

00:10:29.010 --> 00:10:31.450
She's already getting weaker!

00:10:31.450 --> 00:10:33.850
She just has a cold!

00:10:33.850 --> 00:10:37.200
No! It's because
you're draining her energy!

00:10:37.200 --> 00:10:39.830
Her energy? What are you talking about?

00:10:39.830 --> 00:10:40.850
Could it be...?

00:10:40.850 --> 00:10:44.690
Don't you realize?
You're not some normal cat.

00:10:44.690 --> 00:10:48.610
You're a <i>yokai</i> that drains
humans' energy, Sunekosuri.

00:10:48.610 --> 00:10:50.180
Wh-What?!

00:10:50.180 --> 00:10:52.410
Doesn't that ring a bell?

00:10:52.410 --> 00:10:58.800
Has touching a human made you feel better?
Has a human that was with you ever died?

00:11:21.230 --> 00:11:22.860
The pain...

00:11:23.940 --> 00:11:25.660
Someone...

00:11:28.690 --> 00:11:30.260
Oh, you...

00:11:49.030 --> 00:11:50.720
Impossible...

00:11:51.930 --> 00:11:54.950
Then the reason Mom is getting weaker...

00:11:55.350 --> 00:11:58.450
It's not my fault! I won't believe it!

00:11:58.450 --> 00:12:00.040
Wait, Sunekosuri!

00:12:07.230 --> 00:12:10.710
Oh, Shiro, welcome back.

00:12:10.710 --> 00:12:13.590
What's wrong? Come in.

00:12:13.590 --> 00:12:16.430
Here. Come here.

00:12:42.980 --> 00:12:46.170
Shiro... Where are you going?!

00:12:46.170 --> 00:12:48.570
Shiro!

00:12:51.900 --> 00:12:54.170
GEGEGE SONG

00:12:54.950 --> 00:12:58.680
<i>YOKAI</i> SUNEKOSURI

00:12:56.740 --> 00:12:57.620
<i>"I sense </i>yokai<i> activity."</i>

00:12:57.740 --> 00:12:58.620
<i>"I didn't see that..."</i>

00:13:22.980 --> 00:13:24.540
It's open...

00:13:24.540 --> 00:13:25.810
Masae-san is...

00:13:25.810 --> 00:13:29.210
She might be drained of energy
and collapsed.

00:13:29.210 --> 00:13:31.090
Excuse me!

00:13:34.950 --> 00:13:36.370
She's gone...

00:13:41.990 --> 00:13:44.060
FAMILY JOY!
HAPPY CURRY

00:14:08.810 --> 00:14:11.500
Masae-san has gone missing.

00:14:13.210 --> 00:14:16.950
Shiro... Shiro...!

00:14:13.280 --> 00:14:16.650
WARNING! BEARS!

00:14:23.200 --> 00:14:26.810
Shiro, if you leave me too...

00:14:28.690 --> 00:14:31.690
Did the old lady
really go into these mountains...?

00:14:32.840 --> 00:14:34.920
She must be going after the Sunekosuri.

00:14:34.920 --> 00:14:39.090
That Sunekosuri.
Let's hope it doesn't do anything rash...

00:14:39.090 --> 00:14:43.810
But, is it possible for someone
not to realize that they're a <i>yokai</i>?

00:14:43.810 --> 00:14:48.140
Hmm. It looks like this village
used to be thriving.

00:14:48.140 --> 00:14:54.130
It probably drew energy from numerous
random people without realizing it.

00:14:54.130 --> 00:14:59.150
I get it. As time passed, the number of
people passing through decreased...

00:14:59.150 --> 00:15:02.820
If it continued to draw energy from
a single human,

00:15:02.820 --> 00:15:05.680
things like this would be inevitable.

00:15:07.810 --> 00:15:10.830
Please, Shiro...

00:15:10.830 --> 00:15:11.770
Shiro?!

00:15:18.490 --> 00:15:19.900
Mom!

00:15:20.320 --> 00:15:21.840
That voice...

00:15:21.840 --> 00:15:22.820
That way!

00:16:06.600 --> 00:16:07.450
Shiro?

00:16:08.770 --> 00:16:11.850
Shiro... Is that you?

00:16:11.850 --> 00:16:14.490
Shiro... It's you, isn't it?

00:16:18.570 --> 00:16:20.880
Thank goodness.

00:16:21.400 --> 00:16:24.450
I was so worried.

00:16:24.450 --> 00:16:26.080
Mom...

00:16:41.240 --> 00:16:42.850
No!

00:16:45.550 --> 00:16:46.660
Sunekosuri!

00:16:48.160 --> 00:16:49.770
Mom!

00:16:54.370 --> 00:16:58.090
D-Don't hurt m-my mom!

00:16:59.070 --> 00:17:02.970
S-She is my family.
She doesn't belong to you!

00:17:02.970 --> 00:17:05.820
If you're going to haunt someone,
haunt someone else!

00:17:05.820 --> 00:17:09.370
You can haunt me. But not Mom...

00:17:09.370 --> 00:17:11.330
Anybody but Mom!

00:17:11.330 --> 00:17:13.120
Sho, you...

00:17:13.120 --> 00:17:14.980
Mom, stay behind me.

00:17:32.720 --> 00:17:36.240
You've finally found me out.

00:17:42.990 --> 00:17:45.620
Old woman, listen closely.

00:17:46.110 --> 00:17:51.140
I'm a <i>yokai</i> that devours humans' energy.

00:17:52.510 --> 00:17:55.910
And you were
ignorantly calling me, Shiro, Shiro...

00:17:55.910 --> 00:17:58.900
Tricking a sad old woman like you

00:17:58.900 --> 00:18:01.400
was easy!

00:18:03.360 --> 00:18:06.360
Y-You. How dare you!

00:18:07.510 --> 00:18:10.810
Even so, you're still my Shiro.

00:18:11.140 --> 00:18:14.290
You're my precious, sweet Shiro.

00:18:19.650 --> 00:18:23.050
Y-You really are a hopeless old woman.

00:18:23.860 --> 00:18:26.610
If I'm really that precious to you,

00:18:26.610 --> 00:18:27.840
then...

00:18:30.220 --> 00:18:33.470
Then I'll finish by devouring
every last trace of you!

00:18:33.470 --> 00:18:34.770
Sunekosuri!

00:18:34.890 --> 00:18:38.230
Die!

00:18:51.680 --> 00:18:54.030
Help me!

00:19:37.790 --> 00:19:38.700
SHIRO

00:20:56.280 --> 00:20:59.410
Thank you so much. You saved us.

00:20:59.410 --> 00:21:01.560
No, I didn't do anything.

00:21:01.560 --> 00:21:05.710
Our job here is done.
Sho-kun, the rest is...

00:21:05.980 --> 00:21:09.900
Oh well, I guess I'll come visit
when I'm not busy.

00:21:09.900 --> 00:21:14.960
Without me, this old lady gets sad
and might get haunted by a <i>yokai</i>.

00:21:15.280 --> 00:21:19.410
I'm happier without a
good-for-nothing son like you around.

00:21:19.410 --> 00:21:21.920
-What?!
-What of it?!

00:21:25.870 --> 00:21:28.130
So, about our <i>yokai</i> extermination fee...

00:21:28.130 --> 00:21:29.670
-Let's go!
-Whoa! Huh?

00:21:29.670 --> 00:21:32.550
H-Hey, K-K-Kitaro!

00:21:32.550 --> 00:21:34.220
Goodbye!

00:21:39.390 --> 00:21:40.860
Shiro...

00:21:41.850 --> 00:21:43.790
Thank you...

00:22:06.290 --> 00:22:07.460
<i>Oeoeo</i>

00:22:06.290 --> 00:22:07.460
<i>oeoeo</i>

00:22:07.580 --> 00:22:08.830
<i>Oeoeo</i>

00:22:07.580 --> 00:22:08.830
<i>oeoeo</i>

00:22:08.960 --> 00:22:11.500
<i>Oeoeoeoeo</i>

00:22:08.960 --> 00:22:11.500
<i>oeoeoeoeo</i>

00:22:11.630 --> 00:22:16.510
<i>Perhaps the truth lies
In what you can't see</i>

00:22:11.630 --> 00:22:16.510
<i>mienaimono ni koso shinjitsu ga
arukamo nante</i>

00:22:16.630 --> 00:22:19.390
<i>Do you believe that?
If you close your eyes</i>

00:22:16.630 --> 00:22:19.390
<i>kimi wa shinjirukana? me wo tojireba</i>

00:22:19.510 --> 00:22:23.970
<i>A new story will begin</i>

00:22:19.510 --> 00:22:23.970
<i>hajimaruyo atarashii monogatari</i>

00:22:24.930 --> 00:22:30.230
<i>The really important things</i>

00:22:24.930 --> 00:22:30.230
<i>taisetsu na mono wa itsudatte</i>

00:22:30.360 --> 00:22:35.030
<i>Are always things you can't see</i>

00:22:30.360 --> 00:22:35.030
<i>me niwa mienai monosa</i>

00:22:35.150 --> 00:22:37.860
<i>Looking up to a nameless sky</i>

00:22:35.150 --> 00:22:37.860
<i>namae no nai sora wo miage</i>

00:22:37.990 --> 00:22:40.990
<i>I bittersweetly counted dreams</i>

00:22:37.990 --> 00:22:40.990
<i>hiki komogomo yume wo kazoeta</i>

00:22:41.120 --> 00:22:43.620
<i>Are you honest with yourself?</i>

00:22:41.120 --> 00:22:43.620
<i>kimi wa jibun ni shoujikikai?</i>

00:22:43.950 --> 00:22:48.540
<i>The wind tickled my nose</i>

00:22:43.950 --> 00:22:48.540
<i>kaze ga hana wo kusugutta</i>

00:22:48.920 --> 00:22:51.590
<i>Lost in the dark night, oeoeo</i>

00:22:48.920 --> 00:22:51.590
<i>yamiyo ni magirete oeoeo</i>

00:22:51.710 --> 00:22:54.340
<i>Oeoeo oeoeo</i>

00:22:51.710 --> 00:22:54.340
<i>oeoeo oeoeo</i>

00:22:54.460 --> 00:22:56.800
<i>From behind you, oeoeo</i>

00:22:54.460 --> 00:22:56.800
<i>kimi no ushiro kara oeoeo</i>

00:22:56.920 --> 00:23:01.720
<i>Oeoeo oeoe o o o</i>

00:22:56.920 --> 00:23:01.720
<i>oeoeo oeoe o o o</i>

00:23:06.270 --> 00:23:09.940
<i>Dad, that company president
doesn't seem to realize</i>

00:23:10.060 --> 00:23:12.110
<i>where this train is going...</i>

00:23:12.480 --> 00:23:14.940
<i>Next time on GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:23:15.070 --> 00:23:16.780
<i>"Ghost Train"</i>

00:23:16.900 --> 00:23:19.450
<i>The door to the unseen world opens...</i>
